    <!--
      B22: the archive tab drew NOTHING on a cold open and on a failed first page — same
      predicate, same void, as the two list screens. `refresh_error` is the only new sentence.

      `paging_error` was deliberately absent while this screen read `loadState.append` nowhere.
      The append tail is built now (archive-delta §3.1/§3.2), so the reason string exists and is
      used. «дальше» is the append tail's word; the cold-open failure keeps its own sentence,
      because "couldn't load more" is a lie when nothing loaded at all.
    -->
